  "notes": "No motif on the Prophet ﷺ; the Kaaba and their worship are not drawn. 35:9-13 not glossed (Al-Muyassar's «عذاب القتل والأسر» is not displayed). Light for «وهم يستغفرون». STAGING v4: c1 (33) stays ambient: Allah holding back the punishment while the Prophet is among them (his own presence; nothing drawn). Its mood moves from dawn to night_sky (the verse speaks of punishment) and the light plate now starts on 33:12 (their seeking forgiveness), after the Name, instead of one word before the Name. c2 (34-35): three polytheists gathered among themselves at the centre of a town by day, three believers on the right; the polytheists shake their heads on 34:7 (barring the believers: Al-Muyassar); the Sacred Mosque, the House and the Kaaba are never drawn, nothing cube-like or gold stands near 34:9-10 or 35:5, and the centre stays occupied by the gathered group. A soft sparkle on the believers and a lamp plate for the God-fearing (34:17-18; nobody acts the negated 34:11-13); 'most of them' (34:19) gets camera only. 35: the polytheists stay gathered among themselves (never facing an empty side); their whistling and clapping are only named by the gloss (no speech marks that could point at an empty side); on the threat (35:9-13) the camera stays on them, nobody leaves the stage and no event falls."
